Well, you were given a lot of chances... Once you start putting
everything in - I can think about only one (and very brutal)
solution. Crash the game immediately (crash, not quit! If playing
on a micro - switch off/reboot, on a multiuser system kill the
process running nethack). Then apply recover to the remaining
level files. You'll be put (I think) at the beginning of the
current level (as if you just had entered it).

